<codeline lineno="79"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/>and<sp/>Mix<sp/>Cycles<sp/>value<sp/>set<sp/>to<sp/>15.<sp/>This<sp/>value<sp/>is<sp/>not<sp/>available<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>customer<sp/>to<sp/>configure.</highlight></codeline>
